{"id":"659072","name":"酸梅排骨","author":"宸·羽","authorId":"7796837","desc":"","cover":"images/659072/cover.jpg","ingredients":{"main":[{"name":"排骨","amount":"500g"}],"sub":[{"name":"咸酸梅","amount":"2颗"},{"name":"炒芝麻","amount":"少许"}]},"steps":[{"step":1,"desc":"排骨用盐和面粉抓洗干净。","img":"images/659072/step_1.jpg"},{"step":2,"desc":"用盐、酱油、蚝油、淀粉、油腌制入味。","img":"images/659072/step_2.jpg"},{"step":3,"desc":"咸酸梅、冰糖、姜、葱、蒜，备用。","img":"images/659072/step_3.jpg"},{"step":4,"desc":"咸酸梅去核，碾压成泥。","img":"images/659072/step_4.jpg"},{"step":5,"desc":"起锅烧油，排骨入锅煎。","img":"images/659072/step_5.jpg"},{"step":6,"desc":"煎至两面焦黄。","img":"images/659072/step_6.jpg"},{"step":7,"desc":"放入葱姜蒜炒香。","img":"images/659072/step_7.jpg"},{"step":8,"desc":"再放入咸酸梅、冰糖和米醋。","img":"images/659072/step_8.jpg"},{"step":9,"desc":"加入半勺老抽提色。","img":"images/659072/step_9.jpg"},{"step":10,"desc":"倒入清水，没过排骨，焖煮15~20分钟。","img":"images/659072/step_10.jpg"},{"step":11,"desc":"时间到，收收汁出锅。","img":"images/659072/step_11.jpg"},{"step":12,"desc":"撒上白芝麻点缀。","img":"images/659072/step_12.jpg"},{"step":13,"desc":"成品。酸甜开胃。","img":"images/659072/step_13.jpg"}],"tips":"来自 美食天下  的作品\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t使用的厨具：炒锅\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t所属分类：","attrs":{}}